Screen Open 0,320,200,8,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Open Out 2,"AMOSTEST:text.txt"
For I=1 To 40 : Print #2,"Line number";I;" of the text" : Next I
Close 2
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/ready" : Close 9
Read Text "AMOSTEST:text.txt"
Print #1,"back";Screen
T$="#HYP1"+Chr$(10)+"Some {[WORD,3,4]hyper} text"+Chr$(10)+"Second line"+Chr$(10)+Chr$(0)
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/again" : Close 9
Read Text "Title",Varptr(T$),Len(T$)
Print #1,"back2";Param$
Print #1,"end"
